WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.535
WHAT WILL IT TAKE TO END
THIS WAR?

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:07.640
, ARMORED FIGHTING VEHICLES,
AND MUCH, MUCH MORE AMMUNITION.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.743
JOHN KIRBY OF THE U.S. NATIONAL
SECURITY COUNCIL INSIST THAT

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:13.379
THE ALLIANCE IS STILL
ROCK-SOLID ALL ANDS FOR

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:18.184
UKRAINE'S DEFENSE.
&gt;&gt; JOHN KIRBY, WELCOME TO THE

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.686
PROGRAM.
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR HAVING

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.355
ME.
&gt;&gt; THE BIG ISSUE FOR THE DAY IS

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:27.227
THE TANKS, THE TANKS, THE TANKS.
SO, FIRST AND FOREMOST, THE

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:30.296
UNITED STATES APPEARS NOT TO BE
WILLING TO SEND ITS AND ONE

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:33.333
TANKS TO UKRAINE.
WHY NOT?

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:37.403
&gt;&gt; WE ARE STILL WORKING OUR WAY
THROUGH A MYRIAD OF REQUESTS BY

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:40.707
THE UKRAINIANS FOR CAPABILITIES,
CHRISTIANE.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:44.210
WE RECOGNIZE THE ARMORED
CAPABILITY IT'S REALLY

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.446
IMPORTANT AS A FIGHT IN THE
DONBAS AND GET READY TO FIGHT

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.648
IN COMING MONTHS OVER THE
SPRING.

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:52.218
WE EXPECT THERE'S QUITE BE
QUITE A BIT OF GROUND MANEUVER,

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:55.288
WHICH OBVIOUSLY, TANKS WOULD BE
VERY SUPPORTIVE OF.

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:57.857
BUT WE MADE NO DECISIONS ONE
WAY OR ANOTHER.

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:02.195
WE CERTAINLY LOOK FORWARD TO
AND ARE GRATEFUL FOR THE

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:04.297
CONTRIBUTION THAT OTHER NATIONS
ARE WILLING TO GIVE.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:05.998
THE BRITS HAVE AGREED TO GET
SOME TANKS.

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:08.401
I KNOW THE GERMANS ARE TALKING
ABOUT AMONGST THEMSELVES.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:11.337
THOSE ARE OBVIOUSLY DECISIONS
THEY HAVE TO MAKE.

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:13.339
AND WE HAVE TO MAKE DECISIONS
FOR THEMSELVES AS WELL.

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:16.409
I WOULD TELL, YOU THE ABRAMS
TANK IS A VERY SOPHISTICATED

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:19.379
SYSTEM, IT REQUIRES A VERY
LENGTHY, DETAILED, COMPLICATED

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:22.282
SUPPLY CHAIN.
I'M NOT RULING ANYTHING IN A

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:23.483
ROW.
I'M JUST SAYING --

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:26.319
WE WANT TO MAKE SURE AS WE
PROVIDE UKRAINE --

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.955
CAPABILITY, IT'S A TYPE THEY
CAN USE.

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:31.324
AND THEY CAN USE KATE --
IN SHORT ORDER.

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:36.196
&gt;&gt; JOHN KIRBY, A LOT OF PEOPLE,
MILITARY EXPERTS, THINK THE

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:39.399
ABRAMS MAY NOT BE ANY GOOD,
PRECISELY BECAUSE OF WHAT YOU

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:42.202
SAID.
IT'S A GAS GUZZLER, IT'S ALL OF

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:44.403
THAT.
DO YOU THINK THAT IS THE CASE?

00:01:44.403 --> 00:01:47.207
THAT ACTUALLY IT'S NOT WHAT IS
NEEDED ON THE BATTLEFRONT RIGHT

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:49.342
NOW?
&gt;&gt; AGAIN, WE'RE STILL WORKING

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:52.245
OUR WAY THROUGH THAT.
I THINK --

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:55.381
IF YOU JUST TAKE A STEP BACK
FROM JUST THE ABRAMS ITSELF,

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.517
WHEN YOU LOOK AT THE KIND OF
ADVANCE CAPABILITIES WERE

00:01:57.517 --> 00:02:02.155
GIVING UKRAINE, WE HAVE TO BE
MINDFUL THAT WE ARE NOT GIVING

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:06.259
THEM CAPABILITIES THAT THEY
CANNOT ABSORB READILY OR

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:08.194
EFFECTIVELY.
THAT DOES NOT MEAN THEY'RE NOT

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:11.431
SMART, OR CAPABLE.
THEY, ARE WE'RE TRAINING THEM

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:14.667
ON MISSILE SYSTEMS RIGHT NOW IN
OKLAHOMA.

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.502
BUT WE HAVE TO KEEP IN MIND
THERE ABSORPTION RATE.

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:20.306
AND THE ABILITY TO USE THIS
MATERIAL IN SHORT ORDER, AND

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:22.575
VERY EFFECTIVELY AGAINST THE
ENEMY.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:25.345
THE ABRAMS IS A VERY
SOPHISTICATED, CAPABLE TANK.

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:27.647
NO QUESTION ABOUT THAT.
BUT, AGAIN AS WE WORK THROUGH,

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:30.350
WE WANT TO MAKE SURE WE'RE
DOING THIS IN A SMART WAY.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:33.486
&gt;&gt; OKAY, SO THE PROBLEM IS, AND
YOU MENTIONED ALLIES.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:37.356
IT APPEARS THAT, LET'S SAY,
GERMANY, WHICH HAS THE TANK

00:02:37.356 --> 00:02:41.461
VIGIL, THE LEOPARD 2, WHICH IT
SEEMS EVERYONE IS FOCUSING ON.

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:45.365
THE UKRAINIANS WON, IT'S MUCH
MORE FLEXIBLE THAN THE ABRAMS.

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:47.367
IT'S APPARENTLY MUCH MORE
SUITED FOR THAT BATTLEFIELD.

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:53.473
AND YET, IT APPEARS THE GERMANS
DON'T WANT TO BE THE FIRST TO

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:55.575
SEND A TANK.
THEY DON'T WANT TO BE ACCUSED

00:02:55.575 --> 00:03:01.481
OF A GERMAN-LED ESCALATION.
SO, IS THIS GETTING DOWN TO, I

00:03:01.481 --> 00:03:03.850
DON'T EVEN KNOW TO SAY.
BUT THE GERMANS IN THE POLLS --

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.519
THE POLLS ARE SAYING, THIS IS
JUST WASTING TIME.

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:08.855
SOMEONE'S AND THE TANKS
ALREADY.

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:12.392
&gt;&gt; THE BRITS HAVE ALREADY
AGREED TO SEND SOME OF THE

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:14.761
CHALLENGER TANKS, WHICH IS
OBVIOUSLY VERY, VERY WELCOME.

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:21.734
WE WANT TO MAKE SURE --
AND WE HAD THIS DISCUSSION LAST

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:22.835
WEEK.
TANKS WERE CERTAINLY ON THE

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:24.404
AGENDA.
BUT YOU CAN SEE FROM THE

00:03:24.404 --> 00:03:27.440
RESULTS OF THAT MEETING IN
GERMANY HOW MANY DOZENS OF

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:30.443
NATIONS ARE WILLING TO CONTINUE
TO SUPPORT UKRAINE WITH

00:03:30.443 --> 00:03:32.678
SOPHISTICATED WEAPONS SYSTEMS
ON THE BATTLEFIELD.

00:03:32.678 --> 00:03:35.581
AND WHAT'S REALLY IMPORTANT TO
REMEMBER, IS THESE ARE NATIONAL

00:03:35.581 --> 00:03:36.916
DECISIONS.
THEY ARE SOVEREIGN DECISIONS.

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:40.553
I CERTAINLY CANNOT SPEAK FOR
THE GERMANS OR WHAT IS GOING

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:42.522
INTO THEIR CALCULUS ABOUT THE
LEOPARD TANKS.

00:03:42.522 --> 00:03:45.725
BUT LEOPARDS ARE VERY GOOD.
AND THERE'S A LOT OF THEM ON

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:49.362
THE EUROPEAN CONTINENT.
AND CERTAINLY, THEY COULD BE

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:52.598
EFFECTIVE ON THE BATTLEFIELD.
BUT, AGAIN --

00:03:52.598 --> 00:03:55.801
THEY HAVE TO WORK THROUGH THIS
IN A SOVEREIGN WAY.

00:03:55.801 --> 00:03:57.737
THAT'S BEEN OUR APPROACH SINCE
THE VERY BEGINNING OF THE WAR.

00:03:57.737 --> 00:04:01.407
WE WANT NATIONS TO CONTRIBUTE
WHAT THEY CAN WHEN THEY CAN, ON

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:04.444
THE SCALE IF THEY CAN.
BUT WE ARE NOT TWISTING ARMS.

00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:06.779
WE'RE NOT FORCING PEOPLE TO
GIVE MORE THAN THEY ARE WILLING

00:04:06.779 --> 00:04:09.682
TO GIVE.
EACH COMPANY COUNTRY HAS

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:12.485
NATIONAL SECURITY INTEREST TO
PUT HIS --

00:04:12.485 --> 00:04:14.687
CONCERT ON THEIR OWN.
&gt;&gt; BUT YOU SEE THE THING IS,

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:18.424
FOR THE LAST NEARLY A YEAR
YOU'VE ALL SAID THIS IS OUR

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:22.528
JOINT NATIONAL SECURITY CRISIS.
OUR BIGGEST CHALLENGE, OUR

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:26.532
EXISTENTIAL MISSION IS TO MAKE
SURE THAT UKRAINE WINS AND

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:28.668
PUTIN IS DEFEATED.
THAT'S BEEN YOUR MANTRA

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:31.704
THROUGHOUT.
AND NOW, WE'VE GOT WOULD APPEAR

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:36.609
TO BE, ANYWAY, OR BEING
DESCRIBED AS, INCLUDING BY THE

00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:41.447
KREMLIN SPOKESMAN, A DIVISION
BETWEEN NATO ALLIES AND A

00:04:41.447 --> 00:04:43.816
DIVISION BETWEEN NATO AND
UKRAINE.

00:04:43.816 --> 00:04:46.619
THIS IS PLAYING RIGHT INTO
VLADIMIR PUTIN'S HANDS.

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:50.556
&gt;&gt; I WOULD TAKE WHATEVER MR.
PESKOV SAYS WITH A HUGE GRAIN

00:04:50.556 --> 00:04:54.494
OF SALT.
NATO HAS NEVER BEEN MORE

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:57.630
STAUNCHLY UNITED THAN IT HAS
BEEN OVER THE LAST YEAR WITH

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:01.400
THIS WAR IN UKRAINE.
AND OUR LOOKING AT GROWING THE

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:05.605
ALLIANCE BY TWO OTHER NATIONS.
BECAUSE OF WHAT MR. PUTIN HAS

00:05:05.605 --> 00:05:08.474
DONE THERE.
IT'S A LOT OF COUNTRIES IN THE

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:11.444
ALLIANCE.
AND WE'RE NOT GOING TO EVER

00:05:11.444 --> 00:05:14.747
AGREE ON EVERY SINGLE ASPECT OF
EVERY DECISION REALIZED MAKES.

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:16.816
THAT'S WHAT MAKES THE ALLIANCE
SO STRONG.

00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:20.520
THEIR FRIENDS, ALLIES AND
PARTNERS COULD HAVE HONEST

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.789
DISCUSSIONS WITH ONE ANOTHER.
BUT TO SAY THIS IS DIVIDING THE

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:25.691
ALLIANCE ARE SOMEHOW PUTTING
INTERNATIONAL SECURITY AT RISK

00:05:25.691 --> 00:05:29.662
IN UKRAINE BECAUSE THERE'S A
DISCUSSION OVER TANKS IS JUST

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:34.567
WAY OVER BLOWING THIS THING.
&gt;&gt; SO AS YOU KNOW, POLAND HAS

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:38.437
SAID AND OTHERS HAVE SAID THAT
THEY WANT TO SEND THEIR GERMAN

00:05:38.437 --> 00:05:41.707
MADE LEOPARD TANKS IF THEY CAN
GET A SMALL COALITION OF THE

00:05:41.707 --> 00:05:45.445
WILLING TO DO THAT.
THE GERMAN MEN FOREIGN MINISTER

00:05:45.445 --> 00:05:49.582
SAID HER COUNTRY WILL NOT STAND
IN THE WAY OF OTHER COUNTRIES

00:05:49.582 --> 00:05:54.554
DOING THAT SHOULD THEY WANT TO.
BUT IN THE MEANTIME, IS THERE A

00:05:54.554 --> 00:05:56.823
DIFFERENCE OF OPINION ON
STRATEGY?

00:05:56.823 --> 00:05:59.792
LET'S PUT ASIDE THE WEAPONS,
ALTHOUGH IT'S PART OF IT.

00:05:59.792 --> 00:06:03.529
BUT CLEARLY, THE BRITS AND YOU
SAW THE BRITISH FOREIGN

00:06:03.529 --> 00:06:06.566
MINISTER IN WASHINGTON RECENTLY
SAY, NOW IS THE TIME.

00:06:06.566 --> 00:06:09.001
WE BELIEVE, IF THEY GET ALL THE
WEAPONS THEY NEED --

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:15.541
THAT THIS WINDOW OF OPPORTUNITY
IS A TIME TO ARM THE MOB.

00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:17.910
AND BE ABLE TO SCORE A VICTORY
THIS YEAR.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:23.516
BUT, YOUR CHAIRMAN OF JOINT
CHIEFS, MARK MILLEY SAYS, NO,

00:06:23.516 --> 00:06:24.483
NOT THIS YEAR.
WHAT IS?

00:06:24.483 --> 00:06:27.553
IT IS THE UNITED STATES TRYING
TO DRAG THIS OUT?

00:06:27.553 --> 00:06:30.690
TRYING TO WEAKEN THE RUSSIANS?
DOES THE UNITED STATES NOT

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:32.825
THINK THAT YOU CAN SCORE A
VICTORY?

00:06:32.825 --> 00:06:35.528
WHAT IS THE STRATEGIC
DIFFERENCE THERE?

00:06:35.528 --> 00:06:39.865
&gt;&gt; WE OBVIOUSLY WANT TO SEE
THIS WAR AND.

00:06:39.865 --> 00:06:42.635
TODAY COULD IF PUTIN PULLS THE
TROOPS OUT, IT'S NOT GONNA,

00:06:42.635 --> 00:06:44.670
HAPPEN I RECOGNIZE THAT.
WE DON'T WANT TO SEE THIS DRAG

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:50.610
ON ONE SINGLE DAY THAN TODAY.
BUT IN THE MEANTIME WE HAVE TO

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:53.479
MAKE SURE THAT UKRAINE CAN
SUCCEED ON THE BATTLEFIELD.

00:06:53.479 --> 00:06:56.682
SO THAT IF AND WHEN MR.
ZELENSKYY IS READY TO GO TO THE

00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:59.418
NEGOTIATING TABLE, WHATEVER
THAT MIGHT, BE THEY CAN DO THAT

00:06:59.418 --> 00:07:01.554
WITH STRENGTH AND HAND.
HE HAS SUCCESS ON THE

00:07:01.554 --> 00:07:03.523
BATTLEFIELD BEHIND HIM, AND
WIND IN HIS BACK.

00:07:03.523 --> 00:07:06.458
THAT'S WHAT WE'RE FOCUSED ON.
AND EVERY NATION INSIDE THIS

00:07:06.458 --> 00:07:10.396
COALITION OF THE WILLING AS WE
MIGHT CALL, IT IS PROVIDING

00:07:10.396 --> 00:07:11.664
CAPABILITY.
SOMETIMES IT JUST FINANCES.

00:07:11.664 --> 00:07:14.534
AND FINANCIAL SUPPORT.
TO HELP UKRAINE GET INTO A

00:07:14.534 --> 00:07:17.603
BETTER POSITION.
THE STRATEGY ON THE BATTLEFIELD,

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:20.373
THAT HAS TO BE UP TO MR.
ZELENSKYY AND HIS MILITARY

00:07:20.373 --> 00:07:22.508
LEADERS.
HE'S THE ONE THAT'S GOING TO

00:07:22.508 --> 00:07:24.143
DETERMINE WHERE THEY ARE GOING
TO STRIKE, WHEN THEY ARE GOING

00:07:24.143 --> 00:07:27.413
TO STRIKE, AND WHAT FORCE.
WHAT WE ARE TRYING TO DO IS IN

00:07:27.413 --> 00:07:30.616
ADVANCE OF THOSE OPERATIONS,
AND WE EXPECT THE FIGHTING IS

00:07:30.616 --> 00:07:33.419
GOING TO CONTINUE THROUGHOUT
THE WINNER, IT'S BEEN A VIOLENT

00:07:33.419 --> 00:07:35.588
WINTER THROUGHOUT THE DONBAS,
AND INTO THE SPRING.

00:07:35.588 --> 00:07:38.624
IN ADVANCE OF THOSE DECISIONS,
WE WANT TO MAKE SURE THAT WE

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:41.394
ARE IN LOCKSTEP WITH MR.
ZELENSKYY AND HIS MILITARY

00:07:41.394 --> 00:07:43.629
LEADERS ABOUT THE CAPABILITY HE
NEEDS TO GET THEIR.

00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:47.767
A GREAT EXAMPLE OF THIS IS THE
BATTALION TRAINING THAT WE'RE

00:07:47.767 --> 00:07:50.503
DOING OUTSIDE OF UKRAINE AT A
BATTALION LEVEL.

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:55.541
FOR UKRAINIAN BATTALIONS ON
WHAT WE CALL COMBINE ARMS

00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:57.610
OPERATIONS.
IF YOU LOOK AT THE DONBAS A LOT

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:02.514
OF OPEN FARMLAND, OPEN TERRAIN.
THAT IS WHAT MR. ZELENSKYY AND

00:08:02.514 --> 00:08:04.617
HIS MILITARY LEADERS FEEL THEY
NEED TO IMPROVE.

00:08:04.617 --> 00:08:07.853
THEIR COMBINED ARMS OPERATION
IN THAT PART OF THE COUNTRY.

00:08:07.853 --> 00:08:10.623
GOING INTO THE SPRING.
AND SO WE'RE DOING THAT

00:08:10.623 --> 00:08:11.924
TRAINING OUTSIDE OF THE
COUNTRY.

00:08:11.924 --> 00:08:13.092
IT'S NOT JUST THE UNITED
STATES.

00:08:13.092 --> 00:08:16.462
THERE'S OTHER NATIONS INVOLVED.
AND A LOT OF THE VEHICLES THAT

00:08:16.462 --> 00:08:18.631
YOU'VE SEEN US, GIVEN JUST THE
LAST TWO WEEKS --

00:08:18.631 --> 00:08:25.371
THE STRIKER, COMBAT VEHICLES,
THE M WRAPS, FROM IRAQ AND

00:08:25.371 --> 00:08:28.507
AFGHANISTAN.
THOSE MINE RESISTANT, ARMOR

00:08:28.507 --> 00:08:31.477
PROTECTIVE VEHICLES.
ALL OF THOSE ARE GOING TO HELP

00:08:31.477 --> 00:08:35.414
WITH THE UKRAINIAN FORCES IN
THE FIELD, IN THE DONBAS, IN

00:08:35.414 --> 00:08:38.551
THE COMING MONTHS.
WE'RE VERY MUCH TRYING TO STAY

00:08:38.551 --> 00:08:41.020
AHEAD OF THE FIGHT AS MR.
ZELENSKYY SEIZED IT.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:09:10.216
SHOTS DOES NOT CAN YOU TAKE A
BACK INTO THE OR GOVERNMENT MY

00:09:10.216 --> 00:09:11.751
QUESTION IS, DO YOU SEE MANY
STRATEGIST THAT THERE IS A

00:09:11.751 --> 00:09:13.185
WINDOW OF OPPORTUNITY NOW TO
EXPLOIT RUSSIA'S APPARENT

00:09:13.185 --> 00:09:15.221
WEAKNESS, ITS INABILITY TO
REALLY DOUBLE DOWN AND TAKE SO

00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:17.556
MUCH TERRITORY.
BEFORE, YOU ALL SAID, THEY ARE

00:09:17.556 --> 00:09:19.659
REGROUPING FOR A MASSIVE
OFFENSIVE IN THE SPRING.

00:09:19.659 --> 00:09:23.996
&gt;&gt; WE ARE ALL MINDFUL OF THE
TIME COMPONENT HERE, CHRISTIANE,

00:09:23.996 --> 00:09:27.900
AND WE KNOW THAT TIME IS NOT
OUR FRIEND, AND THAT IS NOT THE

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.670
FRIEND OF UKRAINE.
WE HAVE OBVIOUSLY WINTER RIGHT

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:33.839
NOW, WEATHER CONDITIONS ARE NOT
IDEAL FOR FIGHTING, AND YET

00:09:33.839 --> 00:09:36.308
FIGHTING CONTINUES IN THE AIR
AND ON THE GROUND.

00:09:36.308 --> 00:09:39.979
WE HAVE MR. PUTIN CONTINUING TO
STRIKE CIVILIAN TARGETS WITH

00:09:39.979 --> 00:09:44.750
CRUISE MISSILES AND DRONES,
COMING IN FROM IRAN, AND WE

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.720
KNOW, AS YOU RIGHTLY POINTED
OUT, THAT HE IS REGROUPING AND

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:50.823
PREPARING HIMSELF FOR MORE
AGGRESSIVE OPERATIONS TO COME

00:09:50.823 --> 00:09:53.693
IN THE NEXT FEW MONTHS,
PROBABLY IN THE SPRING WHEN THE

00:09:53.693 --> 00:09:56.762
WEATHER GETS BETTER.
AND SO YOU KNOW WE ARE AT A

00:09:56.762 --> 00:10:00.533
CRITICAL POINT, AND PRESIDENT
BIDEN HAS CALLED THIS

00:10:00.533 --> 00:10:01.834
INFLECTION POINT.
AND SO THAT IS WHAT YOU ARE

00:10:01.834 --> 00:10:05.938
SEEING SO MUCH ENERGY BEING PUT
IN BY THE ALLIES TO GET UKRAINE

00:10:05.938 --> 00:10:09.809
THE KIND OF CAPABILITIES THAT
THEY NEED FOR THESE COMBINED

00:10:09.809 --> 00:10:11.677
ARE MANEUVERS, OPERATIONS, THAT
WE THINK THEY WILL BE

00:10:11.677 --> 00:10:13.279
CONDUCTING PROBABLY IN THE NEXT
FEW MONTHS.

00:10:13.279 --> 00:10:16.115
OBVIOUSLY, WE ARE MINDFUL OF
THAT, AND THAT IS WHY YOU'VE

00:10:16.115 --> 00:10:19.985
SEEN TO REALLY BEGIN SECURITY
ASSISTANCE PACKAGES FROM THE

00:10:19.985 --> 00:10:22.021
UNITED STATES ALONE IN JUST THE
LAST FEW WEEKS.

00:10:22.021 --> 00:10:23.722
OTHER NATIONS ARE STEPPING UP
AS WELL.

